{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "source_mode": "sha256-utf8",
  "resource": "MC2Game/Localization/Coalesced.int",
  "input_sha256": "f8ea6f019ba193935e934eec6fa37746efb326957d806fad1f33548e5620c878",
  "entries": [
    {
      "id": "coalesced:e710ef654e9df380c65a5b3298319e6455801b41239df79391b0441b349da871",
      "source_sha256": "09a2f60a4d7bf2c7c63cb080170635a2b9ae9b58d501fbadaf9f85f40384c74f",
      "translation": "这个……还不知道。只有传说称，真名法典能让灾祸种停止。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:1231f065f2dee463ac161e2e1165bd346ac60da2c31a711578a851602477f9e5",
      "source_sha256": "a7e2e5d967bac1a602fef72d68a0dfa1dd9ce18879639c6ce7cf3f74f8e0f996",
      "translation": "真名法典……是说英雄斯特拉斯吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:60bd61e92638d906cef92c0811e46054c2ce2ff9c8467a310338e7d993ee9c93",
      "source_sha256": "b3cfcdb0d7b1d183e15f88c93a9cb305278dd8d463040e07621767c0226fc627",
      "translation": "是的。不过，真名法典也有“超越卡尔塔的卡尔塔”之意，因为斯特拉斯正是那样的存在。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:2d4e04ccb6a242f6b657fffe95352bee190fdc9df39538af6473ca570d1cfa32",
      "source_sha256": "f9e1a38272c14ae8a8231e4c54df0d2a17010697e3d0742d0a2e734cec05b95c",
      "translation": "所以，拥有足以媲美斯特拉斯的强大KAN之人，也会被称为真名法典。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:c0d5cbaccbd3e73bb8b949d4a9bfce57c7cb71e722051dc4ccab1a6e23161adb",
      "source_sha256": "3ee034a5d10049ea0eaba837298ebe7f5d6e225f9bdf100aef8399f2e9fea51a",
      "translation": "但即便有真名法典，不知道停止灾祸种的方法，恐怕也无济于事。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:72f9f8a89e24593c99ef0b7bf54f6bb2bba50b907d14ef3816f05b84e4b21f7a",
      "source_sha256": "71f31de0943fe5acb55d61b577d22909b50395fca5400f80a6f5893cefe7b588",
      "translation": "那不都是迷信吗？以前那些战争英雄，不也常被冠上真名法典的称号？"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:a138dfaf768d1a7474d8da78677ecded180e9cca552381b012e998766877d507",
      "source_sha256": "149c690db0fe22a3e446aaa75ba0c66478e4e97e8973c2a27f70d70b194c22c3",
      "translation": "其实，那时修恩扎伊特称公主为“真名法典”，你还记得吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:40513289af37ab9e9997a606c2363fba54986f00825bc0b77aab6a91ebb8ea0a",
      "source_sha256": "552a45163d891b30fa35d0c62c759161a7a36ce0d63572963f80071f7fcaff27",
      "translation": "真名法典？为什么……"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:c5cbd42ba87125bf87cfa20a4aa533c2fd80b958b5fa3fdd887d69f2d41e1feb",
      "source_sha256": "fc5193c7e5b84f798283575edcda526baf3a1dfac1c27f658457c255503d402c",
      "translation": "她是珍贵的真名法典。必须在战场上不断打磨，直到她体内的卡蒙德成为完美的宝石。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:063dbbb951ff0c49a9eb7137080db2c1ce6cc1212b7d33512aaaef052a914ddd",
      "source_sha256": "c9193f842924f684ffb2d0bc6a396b9d5a4edaacd7bfc2b653f6653e0f8f24a0",
      "translation": "那你为什么要绑架洁菲？说洁菲是真名法典，又是什么意思？"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:c446a009326f23836d0dd3296ce7b9ecd2eb33dfb91d84916c6662895d30cbd4",
      "source_sha256": "15b17d5d2dadac870e195920858f679e1ca3d7f38e7709fba154d90504fcd503",
      "translation": "这场战争……是为了让她蜕变成更强大的真名法典而设下的试炼。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:21fa9859d20ace68a88fe86a17fd071e3b3d9540cd79ecebbb1f47fb76163f32",
      "source_sha256": "2bb27100f11ca697efcaaebff2a4e813df8f9576315ada0ce3dc728e74dac587",
      "translation": "您也不能断定……真名法典就只有公主一人吧？"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:27de74735c817dd64b0b66d4356fce290491e8a33c5d528a25838754e74f6a40",
      "source_sha256": "b83611ef0f70ca1ba601d043995ee78939ff8a17cc0f3f9b06831062b5d8af32",
      "translation": "其实，那个艾尔加，正是作为“替代真名法典”创造出来的。不过，人造的存在，似乎终究比不上真正的真名法典。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:bfa09ec24bf05a3c92a9e1747430e715008db7fd061bb1ab0077839d2c04f76a",
      "source_sha256": "ccbf835453de34aff328327ce9c43306fc01b0d187f1a67b75e1f37e16931d4c",
      "translation": "唯有纯粹继承卡尔塔血脉的人，才有可能成为真名法典。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:1be54c81ab4bb0e4f656000ac025f82cf460a871d3d75552ed5b762efa96fecb",
      "source_sha256": "92ab558d786c2173fba78726944c72ac5d1c5dc5cc31892fc3ab472369d3935f",
      "translation": "修恩扎伊特调查了历来所有被称作真名法典之人的血统。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:829ad868b04152b53218122c8e99975fbb6a4ddeeb3ed0fb4cdf1e3abe0541c4",
      "source_sha256": "fd54af7775afd6c9455144d42861d29bd358c3f7ce13bf384dbda02daddc97c2",
      "translation": "可惜，现存的最后真名法典血脉，就只有王室了。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:a1a817487c04c10e1146942f7a2f0a54def19549cda77355e324ffad5f24d5ee",
      "source_sha256": "ade12114e78e139f9cd49b0f63e708fac808bb07570a476cf8450e562ad872f9",
      "translation": "那就是真名法典。唯有真名法典的奇迹，才能拯救我们。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:20654d5d0474da5131c903ed54c4cb75f9942f38f39b53b12fce9d443869d713",
      "source_sha256": "c1549f1a5e2503151470b10d9fa3f6072c909ac43283697d675cfbfe7f9fe3d2",
      "translation": "那么，如今真名法典在哪里？为找到此人，我不辞辛劳，终于找到了。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:140d1cc8443a583d442063c1f8102ef8ce3d0d0912b5a47765b27cfcd6b1fef4",
      "source_sha256": "444ea7690644b8876dc3e2898118e2c443a4bbeecd068d93be78a8bac56395a3",
      "translation": "正是蕾洁菲尔妲公主。眼前这位，就是独一无二的真名法典。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:07f63cff18fbd94d1f1ace04bdf6f5cd39d6a609dccffab615eb613d7909700c",
      "source_sha256": "7eb3a51c5df90aabc845ffe8f6f32a25a45a297c80f77405b31249a18ef558bf",
      "translation": "所谓真名法典，原本指的是拥有庞大KAN之人。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:5f5739bc418a9344f64a89ac239291c63af36586ccfca04ffa4a6138830c117b",
      "source_sha256": "fcb6867f518b95314ec626b33cfdbf762c392da01d786858a5d0c25b6b6cca16",
      "translation": "唯有真名法典，才能为这个因灾祸种而日渐干涸的世界，带来甘霖般的救赎。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:11eeb69d8a42fb1967f379064054376d5a0cb9328a23d4f21c78581818645c6a",
      "source_sha256": "aa243313d4f04affc8364c5f7e10739448cd2708509053fbb74241055c7e8eb8",
      "translation": "各位或许以为那只是传说，但真名法典曾让灾祸种停止，这全都是历史事实。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:08b79c65a54f89c520102c973a5f1e08abc74811025eea777e312b3cdb5e5a74",
      "source_sha256": "f914d6947163f95758d92ec60ba2a891d4454f5863c00b3763f8f3e145a70deb",
      "translation": "正是因为真名法典崇高的牺牲，我们才能安宁地生活千余年。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:4ef763b994ecde288e15be9e5de8d169462e0f19127b50d45bccda483daf228c",
      "source_sha256": "6dcd659c7434dd66b7a875026bf854714d268e9742dadaebe601c678ce26cd0b",
      "translation": "而如今，只要真名法典做出牺牲，灾祸种就会停止，兰兹海姆也将恢复往昔的模样。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:39bc6d13c86e1d518af81e13c59ca56b915c1572b374cbfc3c6035b7f9bad357",
      "source_sha256": "9b8078352028e1fba5a2cbcab6e7a5fd581cc58a90df18dfba77b3a45ece735c",
      "translation": "这个世界，是靠历代真名法典的牺牲才得以获救的。事到如今，绝不能让一切化为乌有！"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:462cd1dcde75e5dc82ccbdd99344e76af35ea9b5c442f983b6ed2500dbc7fbf3",
      "source_sha256": "7f925b3cc31fc5c29c2d1cebc83c6a3598fe803da49a42ef6a82f05ef9cb4690",
      "translation": "公主是英雄斯特拉斯的后裔，却没有资格拥有真名法典这个光荣的称号。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:fb5b673cc9125a4a01bf2ef901ed1cd72ad36af8d3add1d447965377560b2f9d",
      "source_sha256": "e623504fe1c3ac0f5c1f98ebf91a2a157b3bc966a5911d59c193f8626502dfcf",
      "translation": "这个，如果是身为真名法典的公主，或许有可能……但很危险。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:6855abca63ab2ce3eb0c2f99d45019407229316f8936f3ba3a4a268b5cfab6b3",
      "source_sha256": "0b8c6c7b528d3fa62a2c561c0ed5965edcce7d77ccc02702f2d04154438d8a27",
      "translation": "她就是我们珍贵的真名法典，蕾洁菲尔妲公主。记住这张脸。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:b45b84353d90702e415af1e517ff4dfe7a881072c55873c34420adda6806df93",
      "source_sha256": "755757a4e8e436d005b3168083a8002d8f7ea5efd0dad947def9e55787603d49",
      "translation": "嗯～这份记录的标题是《持有卡蒙德者：真名法典与混血儿》。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:4e319140a1309b721aae7d00ab2ff233f8d818c1f273580f361c3917ec056ad6",
      "source_sha256": "afb3ceca6959f7e10b12ded95b05e509dc614306ca46d7c521f93b306d2ef41a",
      "translation": "能先读和真名法典有关的部分吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:2055d81bd66e4cab7f20b0fe8a49d24da8c04cd9a2faf44736019561db37abd4",
      "source_sha256": "658e671b5c712ee1fc71b833a7b57dfcead98cefd70b2b80013f3f4f8410ba97",
      "translation": "难道那家伙，就是真名法典？"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:7c25ca0d4d80c9ac98c7687fd023a219b9a1651b86e2c16f8f9700411f570b92",
      "source_sha256": "a08d56b7d7a037a9ef671af07b15075429110f71e7b1bc6abbd0a858ab198172",
      "translation": "也许在那个时候，他们也找到了真名法典，并将其牺牲了。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:cdbb843e158a47b54f2bee884588f64c0319f849398e185950c2dc20b208b74c",
      "source_sha256": "cd139a6a7551d2a32f26fc33424e466bd6f5e26d3f02ecc3cebb162360972f66",
      "translation": "可是，为什么非要发动战争？伤亡数万人……明明只要牺牲真名法典，就能结束这一切。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:d50bc819925b3866337a0020b976e356162acadf1bbda94ebac832af58acbbc1",
      "source_sha256": "5500060a9d0a6efae90bdada5088775b51f84a7d94ccc037aa498a0252a33728",
      "translation": "修恩扎伊特以前说过，他发动这场战争，是为了让真名法典成长。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:a130d3f185280c00cb249cf3faf6f354cf3c425c77c091dee39222387535aba7",
      "source_sha256": "41c52093c4600a88949866fe59cab2911512567dc2781a2ab564e68187866a4c",
      "translation": "从数万条生命中产生的KAN，以及真名法典的卡蒙德，就是维持这座乐园的代价。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:15b61a0e50841d50775f9129c0b2ea4be97cc7336cbaa5cd09322f65dc1527b2",
      "source_sha256": "d01764127211a09628c0623d2ecb2fd02800eb1a60bf81e75ed802b114d3c72e",
      "translation": "这和他当时演讲的内容，根本不是一回事啊。不是说，只要牺牲真名法典，就能阻止灾祸种吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:31d961558dc8170711ca945d12324b24269e835defa613b986533357ace7729f",
      "source_sha256": "81d06f9e877a9f2ca2165b047f6174c60b4a366c47dd45bae6b61f10e70e8db5",
      "translation": "你们该不会从一开始，就以为只靠真名法典一个人，就能守护世界吧？"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:d0a85d6e6758b2552991df35eee87688ced28f5e10fbb58959b8c3b53c4ed821",
      "source_sha256": "42db8d8e0681bb6a87a28c4dc0d6e72eb50720f7ff0836faf4e61b305ac0d8e4",
      "translation": "如果你是斯特拉斯……那你自己，不就是真名法典吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:5abb9817d1e165ac9787d47945b4cef6f107a4ef7694a97c242703ac9eda0277",
      "source_sha256": "267ad178aca3fe8ed871f01500bcf0a7d2e7a902272a551a6755900ad2a184e2",
      "translation": "所以，我没能成为……真名法典。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:020dcbf6d07ad182e5101fb85993e034732f21e9dcad8f1192228d2dccfcb5de",
      "source_sha256": "614b43059f310b31d06de5baea61a2ba411a2ab7fea16e62842dda62527bb4c1",
      "translation": "已获得"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:741430301b76d216e415700b0738ea42e9b68cad38a947dac723d87eb51ed2d1",
      "source_sha256": "614b43059f310b31d06de5baea61a2ba411a2ab7fea16e62842dda62527bb4c1",
      "translation": "已获得"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:dbc81cdea455c62566dd104e2fdddf102be753ae509fff7511a69457dd0c39ec",
      "source_sha256": "614b43059f310b31d06de5baea61a2ba411a2ab7fea16e62842dda62527bb4c1",
      "translation": "已获得"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:6dbee1ef082bcfc240981c73ae0fd9b2f28a71cc78201427ebe0a77cb1c41634",
      "source_sha256": "ee2acc927d3c6c54af352d1c2af3d9e529fe94bd9452576db9a35c54cbb550c4",
      "translation": "已习得"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:a16965b09fedf86883ac3ba5dc54ec1a610cc3196a28df2f164ae060c928ee50",
      "source_sha256": "896d2cd45240fba409a8af0cddede3f7fbf159b51030b6742228819263252697",
      "translation": "《真名法典2》中，各角色满足特定条件后，画面上会出现固有技使用标记，此时便可施展各自独特的固有技"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:429901cd21471de8f781b88d6525e760165f20b55901ca423b1d8d0b7a0999b5",
      "source_sha256": "a3b445efc48f2835e22eb9bce2f20f28d155b9dbded526a8f265535a76ec8f73",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:a99b31ccf961b320dd760de3c719ad00c4533e5ed85d0044cc02cdf20182559e",
      "source_sha256": "a3b445efc48f2835e22eb9bce2f20f28d155b9dbded526a8f265535a76ec8f73",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:a2e7b4458d009f37d4db6cba294a6193ad8c7293c7e15fb0a4ca4a46b6a1263e",
      "source_sha256": "78cfbeddca19c0e92c15749f01757b1fe0ce0e840ea6d2ee5895416698b388b5",
      "translation": "《真名法典2》的游戏数据\\n已经损坏。\\n可以在Xbox主界面中\\n删除损坏的数据。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:3af35a7a348f273db2f5aa3c266273cc4d768eb71cf74bbda4cc5dc33a4d2831",
      "source_sha256": "497a9bb47d02906e75764b1333e41e5d9c8d744349c44f59d4de4b5ed8c5bcae",
      "translation": "没有《真名法典2》的\\n游戏数据。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:79d8893a78d11934d1455bec265dc73086de281e740f3c73cf909c448bafbb2d",
      "source_sha256": "1b4aede410a6c0a13133698807bddbca787663ffc519af1c28923f208ce07047",
      "translation": "请通关《真名法典2》，\\n或从XboxLIVE卖场\\n下载短剧。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:0ae46bc6646a61cc38d28f7519fd007ce5f2a43f56d8a50ecff0179cda989615",
      "source_sha256": "6dfbd7ac49385d92f30c0013238ac3f9ec0e42ab845f30aae65966904afb244a",
      "translation": "通关《真名法典2》后，\\n即可欣赏影片。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:d8dc80fbe4bf315d1312bdcf13b85a99da41ef14c84a157e25cd95c7f1d37363",
      "source_sha256": "344fd44de392165d851aac92cc76c7005b2348094ab2e9eef085a28ef8868941",
      "translation": "光盘不正确。请放入《真名法典2》光盘1。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:14041db170daccf7265d06899bf27d52d918f58698dea25d1042757512ac7883",
      "source_sha256": "b29d7f4278d5cf8821f3b50a0bc6c282b8a96d6f71bb9c90bed34279f0cf3a27",
      "translation": "光盘不正确。请放入《真名法典2》光盘2。"
    }
  ]
}
